interface Window { desktop: { loadStore(): Promise<Store>; saveStore(value: Store): Promise<boolean>; chooseFiles(filters: {name:string; extensions:string[]}[]): Promise<string[]>; listMedia(kind: 'conversa'|'gameplay'): Promise<string[]>; chooseFolder(): Promise<string>; openPath(target:string): Promise<string>; probe(file:string): Promise<number>; size(file:string): Promise<number>; encoder(requested:string): Promise<string>; render(payload: {jobs: RenderJob[]; settings: Settings}): Promise<boolean>; onProgress(cb:(value:ProgressEvent)=>void):()=>void; getPathForFile?(file:File):string; libraryRoot?(dir:string):Promise<string>; ensureLibrary?(p:{libraryDir:string;panel:string;channel?:string}):Promise<boolean>; importMedia?(p:{libraryDir:string;panel:string;channel:string;kind:string;files:string[]}):Promise<{path:string;name:string}[]>; removeMedia?(p:{libraryDir:string;files:string[]}):Promise<number>; scanLibrary?(dir:string):Promise<any[]> } }
interface Store { settings: Settings; combinations: Combination[] }
interface Settings { prefix: string; suffix: string; outputDir: string; resolution: string; fps: number; quality: string; encoder: string; libraryDir?: string }
interface Combination { conversa: string; gameplay: string }
